<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile rejects antimony/cadmium offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile rejects antimony/cadmium offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it decided on Jan 27 to make no awards for antimony or cadmium in the bids which opened Jan 14.</p>
<p>Offers for antimony and cadmium will next be received on Feb 11.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
